{"product_id":"classic-bond-nato-strap","title":"'Classic Bond' NATO Strap","description":"\u003Cp\u003EThis strap is a homage to the strap that Sean Connery wore in 'Goldfinger'. A very cool vintage design and the heritage that goes with strap makes it extra special. Currently available in 18mm, 20mm and 22mm.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan\u003EAll of our ballistic nylon straps are made with the highest quality ballistic nylon which has been ultrasonically welded for ultimate durability and comfort. They are then finished with medium weight polished stainless steel buckles for an unparalleled fusion of reliability and design. \u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDid you know this design also comes in a Zulu style strap? \u003Ca href=\"http://www.victorandwells.com/collections/zulu-straps/products/classic-bond-zulu-strap\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"'Classic Bond' Zulu Strap\"\u003EHere\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"\u003EStrap length\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"\u003E: 27.5cm\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStrap Style\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003Cstrong\u003E \u003C/strong\u003EDouble Regimental \u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuckle Style:\u003C/strong\u003E Medium Weight Polished Stainless Steal \u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ca href=\"http://www.victorandwells.com/pages/delivery-prices\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Delivery Prices \"\u003EDelivery Prices\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERelated Blog Posts:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"http://www.victorandwells.com/blogs/news/12124265-how-to-fit-a-watch-strap\" title=\"How To Fit A Watch Strap\" target=\"_blank\"\u003E\u003Cem\u003EHow To Fit A Watch Strap\u003C/em\u003